only worry is that they are growing slowly.","nextNodeIds":[732030112]},{"nodeId":732030112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4232,"speakerName":"Sabbah","textMapHash":4200666370,"text":"Generally speaking, if a germ is in good shape, it should grow quickly enough, but these few have been dormant so far...","nextNodeIds":[732030113]},{"nodeId":732030113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4232,"speakerName":"Sabbah","textMapHash":2984956850,"text":"I'm not sure if it's because the soil isn't fertile enough. I may have to add more fertilizer if this keeps up.","nextNodeIds":[732030114,732030115]},{"nodeId":732030114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":573213570,"text":"Let's fertilize them again.","nextNodeIds":[732030116]},{"nodeId":732030116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4232,"speakerName":"Sabbah","textMapHash":1704252914,"text":"Would you do me this favor, then?","nextNodeIds":[732030117]},{"nodeId":732030117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1011788378,"text":"Piece of cake. We got this!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":732030115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3022555194,"text":"We can try using Dendro again.","nextNodeIds":[732030116]},{"nodeId":732030105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3522879314,"text":"Sorry about Paimon's outburst.","nextNodeIds":[732030106]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7320301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUID